  "notes": "WRITING:\n- {衰|すい} - decline, weaken\n- {退|たい} - retreat, withdraw\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {衰退|すいたい}する - to decline\n- {衰退|すいたい}の{一途|いっと}を{辿|たど}る - to be on a steady decline\n- {衰退|すいたい}が{進|すす}む - decline progresses\n- {衰退|すいたい}に{歯止|はど}めをかける - to halt the decline\n\nCONTRASTING TERMS:\n- {繁栄|はんえい} - prosperity (opposite)\n- {発展|はってん} - development\n- {躍進|やくしん} - rapid advance\n- {成長|せいちょう} - growth\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {衰|おとろ}える - to decline, weaken (verb)\n- {退化|たいか} - degeneration\n- {没落|ぼつらく} - downfall, ruin\n- {凋落|ちょうらく} - decline, fall (literary)\n\nUSAGE:\n- {文明|ぶんめい}の{衰退|すいたい} - decline of civilization\n- {産業|さんぎょう}の{衰退|すいたい} - industrial decline\n- {体力|たいりょく}の{衰退|すいたい} - physical decline\n- {人口|じんこう}{減少|げんしょう}による{地域|ちいき}の{衰退|すいたい} - regional decline due to population decrease\n\nREGISTER:\nNeutral to formal. Common in news, history, and academic discussion.",
